/*
  LiveSignalTail.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0263 · LiveSignalTail (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `LiveSignalTail` resolves (table "LiveSignalTail") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first blocks are the exact set of 17 keys extracted from the web source
  (features/telemetry/components/LiveSignalTail.tsx). The rest backs the
  native-only chrome (error/retry, connectivity banners, live/paused chip) and the
  relative-age labels the web delegates to the shared <FreshnessIndicator>.
*/

